SUMMARY:Dream Outside the Box: Volunteering at MacGregor — Catapult Day
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:MacGregor
DESCRIPTION:Today's volunteering theme is mechanical engineering: each kid 
 builds a catapult from 5 popsicle sticks\, 1 plastic spoon\, and 3 rubber 
 bands\, then launches crumpled paper balls at cup targets worth 1\, 3\, an
 d 5 points. Run of show: 3:15 welcome and table talk\, 3:25 build time (he
 lp younger kids wrap the rubber bands while they hold)\, 3:45 launch chall
 enge\, 4:05 clean up — kids take their catapults home. Bring your photo 
 ID\; if you completed the VIPS certificate and background check there is n
 othing to upload.\nHost: Dream Outside the Box\nRSVP requested by Sun Oct 
 11\, 11:59 PM: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdVO3hmjy66GeWibUG
 imcWVchSzOFXHTFeM7JyXeiX8QIU9og/viewform\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454
 321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/164.html
URL:https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/164.html
CATEGORIES:Service / volunteering
