SUMMARY:Dream Outside the Box: Election Day Volunteering at MacGregor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:MacGregor (cafeteria\, or library if the cafeteria is split for vo
 ting)
DESCRIPTION:Election Day session: kids act as election workers\, make voter
  ID cards\, hear candidate speeches\, vote by secret ballot for a class ma
 scot\, then tally the results and sign a certificate. Schedule: 3:15 welco
 me/table talk\, 3:25 meet the candidates\, 3:35 vote\, 3:50 count\, 4:00 c
 elebrate and clean up (out by 4:15). Volunteers set up before 3:15 (one vo
 lunteer per station plus a lead: posters\, ballot boxes\, booth and pencil
 \, 16 ballots and a voters list per station\, tally board)\; keep it nonpa
 rtisan\, no real candidates or parties. MacGregor is a real polling place 
 today\, so arrive a few minutes early for parking.\nHost: Dream Outside th
 e Box\nRSVP requested by Sun Nov 1\, 11:59 PM: https://forms.gle/Wmeirxc2J
 paP2bDS9\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/e
 vent/273.html
